#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:1
msgid "Filesystem, state, and safety"
msgstr "Sistema de archivos, estado y seguridad"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:3
msgid ""
"The Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria (AEAT) is the external "
"tax authority referenced by the filing and live-read boundaries on this "
"page."
msgstr ""
"La Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria (AEAT) es la autoridad "
"tributaria externa a la que se refieren los límites de presentación y de "
"lectura en vivo de esta página."

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:6
msgid "Local state layout"
msgstr "Disposición del estado local"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:8
msgid ""
"`CADRUMO_LOCAL_STORAGE_ROOT` selects the root of Cadrumo-owned local "
"state. The default depends on how Cadrumo runs:"
msgstr ""
"`CADRUMO_LOCAL_STORAGE_ROOT` selecciona la raíz del estado local propiedad "
"de Cadrumo. El valor por defecto depende de cómo se ejecute Cadrumo:"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Run mode"
msgstr "Modo de ejecución"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Default storage root"
msgstr "Raíz de almacenamiento por defecto"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Source checkout"
msgstr "Checkout del código fuente"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "`<repository>/var/storage`"
msgstr "`<repository>/var/storage`"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Installed on Windows"
msgstr "Instalado en Windows"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "`%LOCALAPPDATA%/cadrumo/storage`"
msgstr "`%LOCALAPPDATA%/cadrumo/storage`"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Installed on Linux"
msgstr "Instalado en Linux"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "`$XDG_DATA_HOME/cadrumo/storage`, or `~/.local/share/cadrumo/storage`"
msgstr "`$XDG_DATA_HOME/cadrumo/storage`, o `~/.local/share/cadrumo/storage`"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Installed on macOS"
msgstr "Instalado en macOS"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "`~/Library/Application Support/cadrumo/storage`"
msgstr "`~/Library/Application Support/cadrumo/storage`"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:18
msgid ""
"Profile state is bucket-scoped under `<root>/buckets/<bucket-id>/`. The "
"bucket contains `db/cadrumo.db`, encrypted blobs, audit material, "
"`manifest.toml`, `.lock`, and an output-language hint. Key material is "
"rooted under `<root>/keystore/<bucket-id>/`. Tokens, logs, secrets, "
"blobs, and audit paths derive from the same product root unless an "
"explicit Cadrumo setting overrides them."
msgstr ""
"El estado del perfil está delimitado por bucket en `<root>/buckets/<bucket-"
"id>/`. El bucket contiene `db/cadrumo.db`, blobs cifrados, material de "
"auditoría, `manifest.toml`, `.lock` y una pista del idioma de salida. El "
"material de claves se aloja en `<root>/keystore/<bucket-id>/`. Los tokens, "
"los registros, los secretos, los blobs y las rutas de auditoría derivan de "
"la misma raíz del producto, salvo que un ajuste explícito de Cadrumo los "
"sobrescriba."

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:25
msgid ""
"Google Drive mirroring uses a Cadrumo-owned `cadrumo-vault/` folder. A "
"former `aeat-vault/` folder is not adopted."
msgstr ""
"La réplica en Google Drive usa una carpeta `cadrumo-vault/` propiedad de "
"Cadrumo. Una antigua carpeta `aeat-vault/` no se adopta."

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:28
msgid "Old `aeat`-named storage is refused, not migrated"
msgstr "El almacenamiento antiguo con nombre `aeat` se rechaza, no se migra"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:30
msgid ""
"Cadrumo refuses recognizable former product state. This includes a "
"sibling `aeat` application-state directory, an `aeat.db` database, "
"`aeat.*`, `aeat-test.*`, or `aeat-tests.*` secure-object namespaces, and "
"former bundle or Drive-folder names."
msgstr ""
"Cadrumo rechaza el estado reconocible de un producto anterior. Esto incluye "
"un directorio hermano de estado de aplicación `aeat`, una base de datos "
"`aeat.db`, los espacios de nombres de objetos seguros `aeat.*`, `aeat-"
"test.*` o `aeat-tests.*`, y antiguos nombres de bundle o de carpeta de Drive."

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:35
msgid ""
"The refusal is non-destructive. Cadrumo does not read, connect to, copy, "
"move, re-key, delete, migrate, or adopt that state. Detection leaves the "
"former bytes untouched and requires the operator to choose a separate, "
"explicit disposition."
msgstr ""
"El rechazo no es destructivo. Cadrumo no lee, ni se conecta, ni copia, ni "
"mueve, ni recifra, ni borra, ni migra, ni adopta ese estado. La detección "
"deja intactos los bytes antiguos y exige que el operador elija una "
"disposición aparte y explícita."

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:39
msgid "Safety and filing scope"
msgstr "Alcance de seguridad y de presentación"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Surface"
msgstr "Superficie"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Cadrumo behavior"
msgstr "Comportamiento de Cadrumo"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Calculation and verification"
msgstr "Cálculo y verificación"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Local; evaluates saved records against bundled registry rules and evidence"
msgstr ""
"Local; evalúa los registros guardados frente a las reglas del registro "
"incluidas y la evidencia"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Export"
msgstr "Exportación"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid ""
"Writes an AEAT-compatible local file after verification and required "
"evidence gates pass; portal acceptance is not guaranteed"
msgstr ""
"Escribe un fichero local compatible con la AEAT después de que se superen la "
"verificación y las comprobaciones de evidencia obligatorias; no se garantiza "
"la aceptación en el portal"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Live AEAT access"
msgstr "Acceso en vivo a la AEAT"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Separately invoked, authenticated, and read-only"
msgstr "Se invoca por separado, autenticado y de solo lectura"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Submission"
msgstr "Presentación"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Forbidden; no Cadrumo submission command exists"
msgstr "Prohibida; no existe ningún comando de presentación en Cadrumo"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Official filing"
msgstr "Presentación oficial"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Performed by a human through an official AEAT channel"
msgstr "La realiza una persona a través de un canal oficial de la AEAT"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Filing history"
msgstr "Historial de presentaciones"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid ""
"Recorded locally after the human filing; reconciliation compares totals "
"and, for enrolled modelos, captured per-casilla values"
msgstr ""
"Se registra localmente después de la presentación por la persona; la "
"conciliación compara los totales y, para los modelos inscritos, los valores "
"capturados por casilla"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "Responsabilidad"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid ""
"The taxpayer or authorized filer reviews figures, meets deadlines, "
"uploads, and retains the justificante"
msgstr ""
"El contribuyente o el presentador autorizado revisa las cifras, cumple los "
"plazos, sube el fichero y conserva el justificante"

#: ../../reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:51
msgid ""
"See [Protect access to your data](../how-to/protect-data-access.md) for "
"recovery, locking, export, and reset tasks. The [filing-boundary "
"explanation](../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md) "
"explains why submission stays outside Cadrumo."
msgstr ""
"Consulta [Protege el acceso a tus datos](../how-to/protect-data-access.md) "
"para las tareas de recuperación, bloqueo, exportación y restablecimiento. La "
"[explicación del límite de presentación](../explanation/recording-a-filing-"
"and-the-boundary.md) explica por qué la presentación queda fuera de Cadrumo."
